TASK: Implement a persistent, crash-safe embedding job queue backed by FrankenSQLite.

This replaces the in-memory Mutex-based EmbeddingQueue (bd-3un.27) with a durable queue that survives process restarts and crashes. The in-memory queue from bd-3un.27 becomes a thin wrapper that delegates to this persistent backend.

SQL SCHEMA:

  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS embedding_jobs (
      job_id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
      doc_id TEXT NOT NULL,
      embedder_id TEXT NOT NULL,        -- Which embedder to use
      priority INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- Higher = process first
      submitted_at INTEGER NOT NULL,    -- Unix timestamp millis
      started_at INTEGER,               -- When a worker picked it up
      completed_at INTEGER,             -- When processing finished
      status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending',  -- pending | processing | completed | failed | skipped
